  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Encrinurus egani has a vaulted knobbly head, articulated thorax and densely ribbed triangular tail shield. Underside anatomy, colour and thickness are inferred, while bump and rib counts are simplified rather than specimen-exact.",
    "zh": "Encrinurus egani 具有隆起且带瘤点的头部、分节胸部和肋条密集的三角形尾甲。腹面结构、颜色及体厚为推断，瘤点与肋条数量经过简化，并非精确标本计数。"
  },
